# Calastone Pulse — Environment Variables (DOCUMENTATION ONLY)
# ============================================================
# Do NOT put a live key in this tracked file.
#
# Required for Market Research (Claude):
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
#
# Preferred (production / preview):
#   Vercel → Project Settings → Environment Variables
#   Add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for Production + Preview, then redeploy.
#   Confirm: GET https://<deployment>/api/claude → {"keyConfigured":true,...}
#
# If Market Research uploads hit a 504 / FUNCTION_INVOCATION_TIMEOUT:
#   That is a function duration limit, not a bad API key.
#   Ensure Fluid Compute is on (Project Settings → Functions) so maxDuration
#   of 300s in vercel.json applies on Hobby.
#
# Preferred (local):
#   1. Copy this file to .env.local (gitignored)
#   2. Set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   3. npm install && npm run db:setup && npm run dev
#
# Required for Neon ontology (system of record):
#   DATABASE_URL=           # pooled — use for /api/* handlers
#   DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=  # direct — use for migrations
#
# Optional aliases (Vercel/Neon templates):
#   POSTGRES_URL=
#   POSTGRES_URL_NON_POOLING=
#
# Local static fallback for Claude (optional):
#   Copy config.example.js → config.js
#
# DO NOT commit .env.local, config.js, or live credentials.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=PASTE-YOUR-KEY-HERE
CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST/neondb?sslmode=require
DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST/neondb?sslmode=require
